             few oracle calls per unit of reward. A second ROUTE-LESS entrant beside
             [loeffler2024reinvent4] and [kim2026s3gfn]. Its sample efficiency is the interesting
             axis for us: it is the strongest case for "you do not need many oracle calls", which is
